Negative control for the control's return to REST.

Drops the `finally`, so a key stays pending forever once its action settles —
the control never re-enables and the row is dead after one click.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: action-feedback.spec.ts — the pending-then-released cases.

